  "title": "gitignore: Add ignores for clangd",
  "description": "I use VSCode together with clangd for development. This merge request adds two files to gitignore:\n- .cache: Subdir where clangd stores its cache files\n- compile_commands.json: Usually a symlink to build/compile_commands.json - clangd gets the compile command line from this file",
